{"seq":12,"slug":"unreal-engine-development","title":"虚幻引擎开发实践","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 虚幻引擎开发实践\n\n虚幻引擎是一个庞大的系统，初学者最常见的困惑不是「某个功能怎么用」，而是「这些功能彼此是什么关系」——为什么对象必须用特定方式创建、为什么有些代码只能写在服务器、为什么编辑器里好好的资产打包后却丢了。这个 hub 的目标不是罗列 API，而是把虚幻拆成四条相互衔接的主线，让你看清整台机器的骨架与血脉。\n\n第一章「核心架构」是地基。它讲引擎如何由模块拼装、UObject 与垃圾回收这套贯穿一切的对象地基、Actor 如何用组件组合出能力、以及 Gameplay 框架如何用固定职责的基类（谁定规则、谁是意志、谁是身体）撑起一个游戏的运行时骨架。这一章定义的概念——反射、GC、生命周期、组件组合——会在后面三章被反复调用。\n\n第二章「编程」从架构落到代码。虚幻的 C++ 是一种被宏与代码生成增强的方言，蓝图是它的可视化孪生，而把二者焊接在一起、也让编辑器与网络得以工作的，是底层的反射系统。理解了反射，第一章里「为什么 UObject 这样创建」「为什么属性能被编辑器看见」才真正讲通；理解了 C++ 与蓝图的分工，才知道一段逻辑该写在哪里。\n\n第三章「渲染与内容」处理「玩家看到什么、内容从哪来」。Nanite 与 Lumen 重塑了几何与光照的制作方式，资产管线决定了内容如何从外部文件一路烹饪打包进游戏，World Partition 与 PCG 则让超大世界的组织与生成成为可能。这一章消费的是前两章的对象与反射机制——资产能被序列化、能被流送，根子都在那里。\n\n第四章「系统与发布」是收尾的硬骨头。网络与复制让多人世界保持一致且不可作弊，动画与物理让角色看起来活着，性能优化与打包发布则把「能跑」变成「在玩家设备上达标并稳定上线」。这一章是前三章的综合考场：网络复制依赖反射，动画物理依赖 Gameplay 框架，性能优化要同时面对渲染、动画、内容的开销。\n\n四章的递进是有意为之：核心架构定下规则，编程教你按规则写代码，渲染与内容用这些代码产出玩家可见的世界，系统与发布让这个世界跑在真实的网络与硬件上。每一篇文档都只深讲属于自己的概念，遇到别处主讲的概念就用交叉链接指过去——你可以顺着读完整条主线，也可以从任意一篇出发、沿链接织出自己的路径。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"core-architecture","title":"核心架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/core-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"engine-architecture","title":"引擎架构与模块系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/core-architecture/engine-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"actor-component-model","title":"Actor 与组件模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/core-architecture/actor-component-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gameplay-framework","title":"Gameplay 框架与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/core-architecture/gameplay-framework"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"programming","title":"编程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/programming","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cpp-programming","title":"C++ 游戏编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/programming/cpp-programming"},{"seq":2,"slug":"blueprints-visual","title":"蓝图可视化脚本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/programming/blueprints-visual"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reflection-properties","title":"反射系统与属性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/programming/reflection-properties"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"rendering-content","title":"渲染与内容","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/rendering-content","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rendering-nanite-lumen","title":"渲染管线 Nanite 与 Lumen","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/rendering-content/rendering-nanite-lumen"},{"seq":2,"slug":"content-asset-pipeline","title":"内容与资产管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/rendering-content/content-asset-pipeline"},{"seq":3,"slug":"world-partition-pcg","title":"World Partition 与 PCG","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/rendering-content/world-partition-pcg"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"systems-shipping","title":"系统与发布","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/systems-shipping","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"networking-replication","title":"网络与复制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/systems-shipping/networking-replication"},{"seq":2,"slug":"animation-physics","title":"动画与物理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/systems-shipping/animation-physics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"optimization-packaging","title":"性能优化与打包发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/unreal-engine-development/systems-shipping/optimization-packaging"}]}]}